<view class="shell">
  <text class="page-context">静宁苹果 · 保险与期货</text>

  <view class="panel">
    <text class="heading">历史价格风险</text>
    <view class="history-row" wx:for="{{history}}" wx:key="name">
      <text class="history-name">{{item.name}} · {{item.count}} 个周度变动</text>
      <view class="metrics">
        <view class="metric">
          <text class="label">周涨跌幅标准差</text>
          <text class="number metric-value">{{item.volatility}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="metric">
          <text class="label">历史下跌频率</text>
          <text class="number metric-value">{{item.declineRate}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <text class="source provenance">标准差衡量历史波动；下跌频率为下跌周数占比。仅使用连续、可比的周度观测，期货剔除主力换月。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="panel">
    <text class="heading">主成分分析（PCA）</text>
    <view class="cumulative">
      <text class="label">前三个主成分累计贡献率</text>
      <text class="number cumulative-value">{{cumulative}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="component" wx:for="{{components}}" wx:key="id">
      <view class="factor">
        <text class="factor-id">{{item.id}}</text>
        <text class="factor-name">{{item.name}}</text>
        <text class="factor-value number">{{item.percent}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="track" aria-hidden="true"><view class="fill" style="width: {{item.percent}}"></view></view>
      <text class="factor-description">{{item.description}}</text>
    </view>
    <text class="source provenance">来源：A3 成果「主成分结果」「主成分解释」。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="panel">
    <text class="heading">样本外预测误差</text>
    <text class="label block-label">最后 12 周（2026 年 8–11 月）</text>
    <text class="label block-label metric-caption">MAPE · 平均绝对百分比误差</text>
    <view class="metrics">
      <view class="metric">
        <text class="label">{{arimaName}}</text>
        <text class="number metric-value">{{arimaMape}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="metric">
        <text class="label">随机游走基准</text>
        <text class="number metric-value">{{baselineMape}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <text class="interpretation">本次测试的误差仅相差 <text class="number difference">{{mapeGap}} 个百分点</text>。</text>
    <text class="source provenance">来源：A4 成果「检验与模型」「预测与误差」。</text>
    <text class="source forecast-note">预测均值路径已知数值见价格走势页。</text>
  </view>

  <navigator class="action" url="/pages/insurance/index"><text>保险测算</text><text class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</text></navigator>
</view>
